{"obs_mqv8wan0_b8f478b399f2":{"observation":{"hookType":"session_updated","id":"obs_mqv8wan0_b8f478b399f2","raw":{"additions":null,"deletions":null,"files":null,"parentID":"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI","title":"Fix Dockerfile + K8s manifests (@devops/docker-specialist subagent)"},"sessionId":"ses_0fae0fe25ffebUi4vEn7eU1ecL","timestamp":"2026-06-26T18:09:06.010Z"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqv8wan4_5a54aaf34796":{"observation":{"hookType":"prompt_submit","id":"obs_mqv8wan4_5a54aaf34796","raw":{"agent":"devops/docker-specialist","files":[],"model":{"modelID":"big-pickle","providerID":"opencode"},"parts_summary":["text"],"prompt":"Fix 4 issues in the deploy/ directory. Read the files first, then apply edits.\n\n**Bug 1: /Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/docker/nexi.Dockerfile (High)**\n- Line 1: `FROM python:3.11-slim` â€” pyproject.toml requires `>=3.13`. Change to `FROM python:3.13-slim`\n- There is no .dockerignore â€” create one at the repo root `/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/.dockerignore`:\n```\n**/__pycache__\n**/*.pyc\n**/tests/\n**/.pytest_cache\n```\n\n**Bug 2: /Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/jobs/consolidation-cronjob.yaml (High)**\n- Lines 20-21: `$(POSTGRES_PASSWORD)` is not injected from any Secret. Fix: Add env var with secretKeyRef before the XNCH_POSTGRES_URL env var:\n```yaml\nenv:\n  - name: POSTGRES_PASSWORD\n    valueFrom:\n      secretKeyRef:\n        name: xnch-secret\n        key: postgres_password\n  - name: XNCH_POSTGRES_URL\n    value: postgresql://xnch:$(POSTGRES_PASSWORD)@postgres-pgvector:5432/xnch\n```\nRead the actual file first to see the exact structure.\n\n**Bug 3: /Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/i7-node/xnch-deployment.yaml (Low)**\n- Same $(POSTGRES_PASSWORD) expansion issue. Add the same secretKeyRef block before the XNCH_POSTGRES_URL env var.\nRead the file first to find the exact location.\n\nReturn a summary of every change (file, line, what changed).","variant":null},"sessionId":"ses_0fae0fe25ffebUi4vEn7eU1ecL","timestamp":"2026-06-26T18:09:06.013Z","userPrompt":"Fix 4 issues in the deploy/ directory. Read the files first, then apply edits.\n\n**Bug 1: /Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/docker/nexi.Dockerfile (High)**\n- Line 1: `FROM python:3.11-slim` â€” pyproject.toml requires `>=3.13`. Change to `FROM python:3.13-slim`\n- There is no .dockerignore â€” create one at the repo root `/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/.dockerignore`:\n```\n**/__pycache__\n**/*.pyc\n**/tests/\n**/.pytest_cache\n```\n\n**Bug 2: /Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/jobs/consolidation-cronjob.yaml (High)**\n- Lines 20-21: `$(POSTGRES_PASSWORD)` is not injected from any Secret. Fix: Add env var with secretKeyRef before the XNCH_POSTGRES_URL env var:\n```yaml\nenv:\n  - name: POSTGRES_PASSWORD\n    valueFrom:\n      secretKeyRef:\n        name: xnch-secret\n        key: postgres_password\n  - name: XNCH_POSTGRES_URL\n    value: postgresql://xnch:$(POSTGRES_PASSWORD)@postgres-pgvector:5432/xnch\n```\nRead the actual file first to see the exact structure.\n\n**Bug 3: /Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/i7-node/xnch-deployment.yaml (Low)**\n- Same $(POSTGRES_PASSWORD) expansion issue. Add the same secretKeyRef block before the XNCH_POSTGRES_URL env var.\nRead the file first to find the exact location.\n\nReturn a summary of every change (file, line, what changed)."},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqv8wanb_2ba198b5e572":{"observation":{"hookType":"session_status","id":"obs_mqv8wanb_2ba198b5e572","raw":{"attempt":null,"message":"","status_type":"busy"},"sessionId":"ses_0fae0fe25ffebUi4vEn7eU1ecL","timestamp":"2026-06-26T18:09:06.022Z"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqv8wand_e39c3c93c2fd":{"observation":{"hookType":"assistant_message","id":"obs_mqv8wand_e39c3c93c2fd","raw":{"cost":0,"duration_ms":null,"error":null,"finish":null,"messageID":"msg_f051f01e60024Ddl0QEMVN1r10","mode":"devops/docker-specialist","modelID":"big-pickle","parentID":"msg_f051f01db002kAX4hLOEC72GfY","providerID":"opencode","tokens":{"cache_read":0,"cache_write":0,"input":0,"output":0,"reasoni